title: "Universal Law: research website and reproduction guide for Gaussian random fields and persistence"
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the research website and reproduction surface. Include
  the exact commit used. For a proof, calculation or imported source, cite that
  object's own authorship, source identity and stated scope instead.
